---
title: "accrue_interest (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_calc_util: util_rate = debt / (cash + borrows - reserves)
    q_calc_util --> q_calc_rate: calc_interest(interest_model, util_rate)
    q_calc_rate --> q_check_time: interest_rate determined by kink model
    q_check_time --> q_skip: last_updated == now
    q_check_time --> q_calc_factor: last_updated < now
    q_skip --> [*]: return (no update needed)
    q_calc_factor --> q_calc_accumulated: simple_interest_factor = rate * (now - last_updated)
    q_calc_accumulated --> q_update_debt: interest_accumulated = debt * simple_interest_factor
    q_update_debt --> q_update_reserve: debt = debt + interest_accumulated
    q_update_reserve --> q_update_index: cash_reserve += reserve_factor * interest_accumulated
    q_update_index --> [*]: borrow_index = (1 + simple_interest_factor) * borrow_index_prior

    note right of q_calc_rate
        INV-001: borrow_index monotonically non-decreasing
        INV-002: last_updated monotonically non-decreasing
        INV-003: tri-linear interest rate model with mid_kink and high_kink
        INV-004: if util <= mid_kink: rate = base + (util/mid_kink) * (rate_mid - base)
        INV-005: if util <= high_kink: rate = rate_mid + ((util-mid)/(high-mid)) * (rate_high - rate_mid)
        INV-006: if util > high_kink: rate = rate_high + ((util-high)/(1-high)) * (max_rate - rate_high)
    end note
